{"id":"d4fa6503114734cd","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-logic-over-type-theory.md","title":"df-logic-over-type-theory","display":"df-logic-over-type-theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-logic-over-type-theory","aliases":["16-df-logic-over-type-theory","Logic over a type theory"],"display":"df-logic-over-type-theory","depends_on":["[[16-df-logic-fibration]]"],"source":"§3.1, §4.3, §11.1–11.2; local presentation predicate using the directory LogicFib structure","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-logic-over-type-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-logic-over-type-theory</span><span>Logic over a type theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-logic-over-type-theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"45918fba7ae3214d\" href=\"?note=45918fba7ae3214d\" title=\"16-df-logic-fibration\">16-df-logic-fibration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§3.1, §4.3, §11.1–11.2; local presentation predicate using the directory LogicFib structure"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 是具有语境范畴 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_T\">\\(\\mathcal B_T\\)</span> 的类型论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 给定每个语境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 的公式集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fml}_L(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Fml}_L(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、反身传递的可推导关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_L\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\psi\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_L\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\psi\\)</span> 及沿语境态射的捕获避免代入。代入保持可推导关系，并在公式可证等价类上满足恒等和复合律。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B_T\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B_T\\)</span> 是候选带提升选择的纤维化；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogicFib}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{LogicFib}(p)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"45918fba7ae3214d\" href=\"?note=45918fba7ae3214d\" title=\"16-df-logic-fibration\">16-df-logic-fibration</a> 的本地组合结构（包括一般量词及其 BC/Frobenius）。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_\\Gamma\">\\(\\mathcal E_\\Gamma\\)</span> 为其纤维，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_\\Gamma\">\\(\\leq_\\Gamma\\)</span> 表示该纤维的箭头存在关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{L,\\Gamma}\">\\(\\equiv_{L,\\Gamma}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogicOver}_T(L;p)\">\\(\\mathrm{LogicOver}_T(L;p)\\)</span> 在下节定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\varphi]\">\\([\\varphi]\\)</span> 为相应等价类。下式对全部语境、全部相应公式及全部显示源靶的代入作显式量化。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\equiv_{L,\\Gamma}\\psi\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\Gamma\\vdash_L\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\psi)\\land(\\Gamma\\vdash_L\\psi\\Rightarrow\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi\\equiv_{L,\\Gamma}\\psi\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\Gamma\\vdash_L\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\psi)\\land(\\Gamma\\vdash_L\\psi\\Rightarrow\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LogicOver}_T(L;p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{LogicFib}(p)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B_T)\\bigl[\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_\\Gamma=\n\\operatorname{Fml}_L(\\Gamma)/{\\equiv_{L,\\Gamma}}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_L(\\Gamma))\n([\\varphi]\\leq_\\Gamma[\\psi]\\Longleftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_L\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\psi)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B_T)(\\forall\\sigma:\\Delta\\to\\Gamma)\n(\\forall\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_L(\\Gamma))\\ \\sigma^*([\\varphi])=[\\varphi[\\sigma]].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LogicOver}_T(L;p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{LogicFib}(p)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B_T)\\bigl[\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_\\Gamma=\n\\operatorname{Fml}_L(\\Gamma)/{\\equiv_{L,\\Gamma}}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_L(\\Gamma))\n([\\varphi]\\leq_\\Gamma[\\psi]\\Longleftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_L\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\psi)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B_T)(\\forall\\sigma:\\Delta\\to\\Gamma)\n(\\forall\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_L(\\Gamma))\\ \\sigma^*([\\varphi])=[\\varphi[\\sigma]].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>公式的相互可推导性为等价关系，代入保持推导保证商上的重索引良定义。这里沿用原稿的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogicFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{LogicFib}\\)</span> 强组合条件，因而是这种特定纤维模型与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的句法纤维相匹配的本地谓词；不是声称任意置于类型论上的逻辑都自动具有所有一般量词。书中相关原则见 §3.1、§4.3、§11.1–11.2。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-logic-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"45918fba7ae3214d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-logic-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-logic-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"45918fba7ae3214d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B_T$ 是候选带提升选择的纤维化；$\\mathrm{LogicFib}(p)$ 采用 [[16-df-logic-fibration]] 的本地组合结构（包括一般量词及其 BC/Frobenius）。$\\mathcal E_\\Gamma$ 为其纤维，$\\leq_\\Gamma$ 表示该纤维的箭头存在关系。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_T","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fml}_L(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_L\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LogicFib}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_{L,\\Gamma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LogicOver}_T(L;p)","display":false},{"tex":"[\\varphi]","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\equiv_{L,\\Gamma}\\psi\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\Gamma\\vdash_L\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\psi)\\land(\\Gamma\\vdash_L\\psi\\Rightarrow\\varphi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LogicOver}_T(L;p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{LogicFib}(p)\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B_T)\\bigl[\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_\\Gamma=\n\\operatorname{Fml}_L(\\Gamma)/{\\equiv_{L,\\Gamma}}\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land(\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_L(\\Gamma))\n([\\varphi]\\leq_\\Gamma[\\psi]\\Longleftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_L\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\psi)\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B_T)(\\forall\\sigma:\\Delta\\to\\Gamma)\n(\\forall\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_L(\\Gamma))\\ \\sigma^*([\\varphi])=[\\varphi[\\sigma]].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LogicFib}","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false}],"bytes":2424,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-282","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-logic-over-type-theory|df-logic-over-type-theory]]"}],"outgoing":["45918fba7ae3214d"]}